---
import { AlertCircle, Clock, EyeOff, Bot } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section id="problem" class="problem-8">
  <div class="glow-decor"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header text-center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Jujur deh. Kamu capek nggak?</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Kebanyakan guru menghadapi tantangan berat yang sama setiap hari:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="problem-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="problem-card">
        <div class="icon-wrapper bg-red">
          <Clock class="icon" />
        </div>
        <h3>Capek Bikin Materi Dari Nol</h3>
        <p>Tiap minggu habis waktu berjam-jam cuma buat nyiapin bahan ajar, padahal masih banyak tugas administrasi lain.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="problem-card">
        <div class="icon-wrapper bg-orange">
          <EyeOff class="icon" />
        </div>
        <h3>Siswa Ngantuk & Bosan</h3>
        <p>Udah capek-capek bikin slide materi biasa, tapi pas di kelas siswa malah malas-malasan, ngantuk, dan tidak fokus.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="problem-card">
        <div class="icon-wrapper bg-purple">
          <Bot class="icon" />
        </div>
        <h3>Bingung Cara Pakai AI</h3>
        <p>Sering dengar katanya AI itu "canggih" dan bisa bantu guru, tapi bingung mulainya dari mana dan gimana cara pakainya.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="middle-text text-center">
      <p class="comparison-lead">
        Sementara guru lain sudah jauh di depan — materi mereka <strong>interaktif, seru,</strong> dan <strong>siswa betah belajar</strong> sampai selesai.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hook-box">
      <div class="hook-content">
        <AlertCircle class="hook-icon" />
        <p class="hook-text">
          Masalahnya bukan kamu kurang kreatif. Kamu cuma belum punya alat yang tepat.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-8 {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background-color: #0b0f19;
    color: #f8fafc;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .glow-decor {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 20%;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.03) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .header {
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .problem-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    padding: 36px 30px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .problem-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.05);
  }

  .icon-wrapper {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .icon-wrapper .icon {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    color: white;
  }

  .bg-red { background: #ef4444; }
  .bg-orange { background: #f97316; }
  .bg-purple { background: #8b5cf6; }

  .problem-card h3 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .problem-card p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .middle-text {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 50px;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .comparison-lead {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .comparison-lead strong {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .hook-box {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
    border-left: 6px solid #f59e0b;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px 30px;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hook-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .hook-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    color: #f59e0b;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .hook-text {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 750;
    color: #fde047;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-align: left;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .problem-8 {
      padding: 70px 0;
    }

    .problem-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 30px;
    }

    .hook-content {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .hook-text {
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
